// SFX — Done!/Ready click (ready-up press in DRAWING; also the Unready toggle's louder sibling moment)
// Status: DONE (owner-approved 2026-07-19: "perfect")
// The "yes!" answer to sfx-button-press: same triangle UI voice, opposite direction —
// button press bends DOWN, ready hops UP (F4 -> C5).
// Render: one hit, WAV. Audition pattern clicks once per second.
// Paste into https://strudel.cc — spec: TDD/sound/stinger-sfx-spec.md

setcpm(60)

note("[f4 c5@2] ~ ~ ~")
  .sound("triangle")
  .attack(.001).decay(.1).sustain(0).release(.04)
  .lpf(2400)
  .gain(.45)
